   "prompt": "<p>For the following exercises, verify the derivatives and antiderivatives.</p><p>$\\frac{d}{dx}\\ln(x+\\sqrt{x^{2}+1})=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1+x^{2}}}$</p>",
   "answer": {
