   "prompt": "<p>For the following exercises, verify the derivatives and antiderivatives.</p><p>$\\frac{d}{dx}\\ln(x+\\sqrt{x^{2}-a^{2}})=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x^{2}-a^{2}}}$</p>",
