   "prompt": "<p>For the following exercises, verify the derivatives and antiderivatives.</p><p>$\\int \\frac{dx}{x\\;\\ln(x)\\ln(\\ln x)}=\\ln(\\ln(\\ln x))+C$</p>",
   "answer": {
